                "stage": "deterministic_svg"
              },
              "value": {
                "html": "<ol data-layout=\"source-subparts\" type=\"a\"><li data-list-marker=\"а)\">Ре­ши­те урав­не­ние <span data-inline-latex=\"750^{\\cos 3x}+6\\cdot 125^{\\frac{1}{3}+\\cos 3x}=5^{5\\cos 3x}+30^{1+\\cos 3x}\"></span> .</li><li data-list-marker=\"б)\">Най­ди­те все корни урав­не­ния, при­над­ле­жа­щие от­рез­ку  <span data-inline-latex=\"[-\\frac{7\\pi}{4};-\\frac{3\\pi}{4}]\"></span> . </li></ol>",
                "title": "Условие",
                "asset_keys": []
              },
              "operation": "rewrite",
              "transformation_target_id": "section:condition:1"
            },
            {
              "at": "2026-10-02T19:24:01.560985+00:00",
              "by": {
                "type": "pipeline",
                "stage": "deterministic_svg"
              },
              "value": {
                "html": "<p>а)  <span data-inline-latex=\"\\{\\frac{\\pi}{6}+\\frac{\\pi k}{3}\\mid k\\in\\mathbb{Z}\\}\"></span> ;  б)  <span data-inline-latex=\"-\\frac{3\\pi}{2}\"></span> ,   <span data-inline-latex=\"-\\frac{7\\pi}{6}\"></span> ,   <span data-inline-latex=\"-\\frac{5\\pi}{6}\"></span> . </p>",
                "title": "Ответ",
                "asset_keys": []
              },
              "operation": "rewrite",
              "transformation_target_id": "section:answer:1"
            },
            {
              "at": "2026-10-02T19:24:01.560985+00:00",
              "by": {
                "type": "pipeline",
                "stage": "deterministic_svg"
              },
              "value": {
                "html": "<ol data-layout=\"source-subparts\" type=\"a\"><li data-list-marker=\"а)\">Пусть <span data-inline-latex=\"t=\\cos 3x\"></span>,  тогда:<center><p><span><span data-inline-latex=\"750^t+6\\cdot125^{\\frac{1}{3}+t}=5^{5t}+30^{1+t}\\Leftrightarrow 5^{3t}\\cdot6^t+30\\cdot5^{3t}=5^{5t}+30\\cdot5^t\\cdot6^t\\Leftrightarrow 5^{2t}\\cdot6^t+30\\cdot5^{2t}=5^{4t}+30\\cdot6^t\\Leftrightarrow 5^{2t}(6^t-5^{2t})-30(6^t-5^{2t})=0\\Leftrightarrow (5^{2t}-30)(6^t-25^t)=0\\Leftrightarrow \\left[\\begin{aligned}5^{2t}&amp;=30,\\\\6^t&amp;=25^t\\end{aligned}\\right.\\Leftrightarrow \\begin{cases}2t=\\log_5 30,\\\\\\left(\\frac{6}{25}\\right)^t=1\\end{cases}\\Leftrightarrow \\left[\\begin{aligned}t&amp;=\\frac{1}{2}\\log_5 30,\\\\t&amp;=0.\\end{aligned}\\right.\"></span></span></p></center><img alt=\"\" data-asset-id=\"c078761c-fa3f-48cb-aeb4-8a1a5c41735f\" data-asset-key=\"image_1\" data-transformation-target-id=\"asset:image_1\"/><p>За­ме­тим, что </p><center><p> <span data-inline-latex=\"\\frac{1}{2}\\log_5 30\\gt \\frac{1}{2}\\log_5 25=\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot 2=1\"></span>, </p></center><p>по­это­му урав­не­ние  <span data-inline-latex=\"\\cos 3x=\\frac{1}{2}\\log_5 30\"></span> не имеет ре­ше­ний. Оста­лось ре­шить урав­не­ние  <span data-inline-latex=\"\\cos 3x=0\"></span>:</p><center><p> <span data-inline-latex=\"\\cos 3x=0\\iff 3x=\\frac{\\pi}{2}+\\pi k\\iff x=\\frac{\\pi}{6}+\\frac{\\pi k}{3},\\quad k\\in\\mathbb{Z}\"></span> . </p></center></li><li data-list-marker=\"б)\">От­бе­рем корни при по­мо­щи еди­нич­ной окруж­но­сти. Под­хо­дят:  <span data-inline-latex=\"-\\frac{3\\pi}{2}\"></span> ,   <span data-inline-latex=\"-\\frac{7\\pi}{6}\"></span> ,   <span data-inline-latex=\"-\\frac{5\\pi}{6}\"></span> . </li></ol>",
                "title": "Решение",
                "asset_keys": [
                  "image_1"
                ]
              },
              "operation": "rewrite",
              "transformation_target_id": "section:solution:1"
            },
