                "html": "<p><img alt=\"\" data-asset-id=\"9352852a-9c3f-4b98-b97f-07c27d9107b6\" data-asset-key=\"image_1\" data-transformation-target-id=\"asset:image_1\"/></p><p>а)  Пре­об­ра­зу­ем урав­не­ние:</p><center><p><span> <span data-inline-latex=\"750^{\\cos 3x}+6\\cdot 125^{\\frac{1}{3}+\\cos 3x}=5^{5\\cos 3x}+30^{1+\\cos 3x}\\iff\"></span> <br/> <span data-inline-latex=\"\\iff (6\\cdot 5^{3})^{\\cos 3x}+6\\cdot 5^{1+3\\cos 3x}-5^{5\\cos 3x}-(6\\cdot 5)^{1+\\cos 3x}=0\\iff\"></span> <br/> <span data-inline-latex=\"\\iff (6\\cdot 5)^{\\cos 3x}(5^{2\\cos 3x}-30)-5^{3\\cos 3x}(5^{2\\cos 3x}-30)=0\\iff (6^{\\cos 3x}-5^{2\\cos 3x})(5^{2\\cos 3x}-30)=0\\iff\"></span> <br/> <span data-inline-latex=\"\\iff \\left[\\begin{aligned}6^{\\cos 3x}=25^{\\cos 3x}\\\\25^{\\cos 3x}=30\\end{aligned}\\right..\\quad \\iff \\left[\\begin{aligned}\\cos 3x=0\\\\\\cos 3x=\\log_{(25)} 30\\gt 1\\end{aligned}\\right..\\quad \\iff 3x=\\frac{\\pi}{2}+\\pi k\\iff x=\\frac{\\pi}{6}+\\frac{\\pi k}{3},\\quad k\\in\\mathbb{Z}\"></span> . </span></p></center><p>б)  От­бе­рем корни при по­мо­щи еди­нич­ной окруж­но­сти (см. рис.). По­лу­ча­ем корни  <span data-inline-latex=\"-\\frac{3\\pi}{2}\"></span> ,   <span data-inline-latex=\"-\\frac{7\\pi}{6}\"></span> ,   <span data-inline-latex=\"-\\frac{5\\pi}{6}\"></span> . </p>",
